  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ResPdfSharp fork: this package embeds fallback fonts (Arimo, Tinos, Cousine, SIL OFL 1.1)\nso font rendering works out of the box on Linux and in containers without system fonts.\nSee THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt in the source repository.\nThis is a version of PDFsharp and MigraDoc compatible with .NET 8 and higher.\nThe package ‘PDFsharp-MigraDoc’ can be used on any platform including Windows and Linux. The Target Frameworks are ‘net8.0’, ‘net9.0’, ‘net10.0’ and ‘netstandard2.0’.\nThe packages ‘PDFsharp-MigraDoc-GDI’ and ‘PDFsharp-MigraDoc-WPF’ can be used under Windows only. The Target Frameworks are ‘net8.0-windows’, ‘net9.0-windows’, ‘net10.0-windows’ and ‘net462’.\nSee the project docs site for further information:\nhttps://github.com/respellion/respdfsharp",
